# loft_ring_guide.tlspr's closed loft held by the six cubics of its
# guide sketch, picked with the mouse and set by Features > Guide Loft by
# Selected Curves, then its screen shown from the group list and held
# square to its third profile by that row's [change] given 1; the same
# as path_loft_ring_guide_held.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/loft_ring_guide_held).
